<title>NETHERLANDS: AKZO NOBEL Q4 NET 291 MLN GUILDERS.</title>
<headline>AKZO NOBEL Q4 NET 291 MLN GUILDERS.</headline>
<dateline>ARNHEM, Netherlands 1997-02-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Fourth quarter 1996</p>
<p>(millions of guilders unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit incl. extraordinary items   291  vs  201</p>
<p>    Ditto per share (guilders)		4.09  vs  2.83</p>
<p>    Net profit excl. extraordinary items   291  vs  239</p>
<p>    Ditto per share (guilders)		4.09  vs  3.36</p>
<p>    Turnover (billions)			 5.69  vs  5.28</p>
<p>    Operating profit			     482  vs  365</p>
<p>NOTE - Analysts had forecast a net profit excluding</p>
<p>extraordinary items of 273 to 320 million guilders.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
</text>
